<div class="embla__slide">
  <div class="slide-content flex flex-col items-center text-center">
    <h2>Compliance & Legal Risk</h2>
    <p style="color: #aaa; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 30px;">
      Комплаенс-ограничения, обязательные к учёту в архитектуре и GTM ({{ scope_analytics.compliance_flags|length }}).
    </p>
    <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 760px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; text-align: left;">
      {% for flag in scope_analytics.compliance_flags %}
      <div class="metric-card" style="border-left: 4px solid #f87171; padding: 16px 22px;">
        <span style="color: #fff;">{{ flag }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
